{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"107","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Basketball Team"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As a German University in Cairo (GUC) student and a basketball player, Herr Wafa was delighted once he heard the news. GUC is finally participating in the Annual Basketball Competition (ABC). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A team is to be formed of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" players, all of which are GUC students. However, the team might have players belonging to different departments. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" departments in GUC, numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":". Herr Wafa's department has number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h"},{"kind":"text","text":". For each department "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":", Herr Wafa knows number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":" — how many students who play basketball belong to this department."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Herr Wafa was also able to guarantee a spot on the team, using his special powers. But since he hates floating-point numbers, he needs your help at finding the probability that he will have at least one teammate belonging to his department. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that every possible team containing Herr Wafa is equally probable. Consider all the students different from each other."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100, 1 ≤ m ≤ 1000, 1 ≤ h ≤ m"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of players on the team, the number of departments in GUC and Herr Wafa's department, correspondingly. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a single-space-separated list of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ si ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the number of students in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th department. Note that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"sh"},{"kind":"text","text":" includes Herr Wafa."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the probability that Herr Wafa will have at least one teammate from his department. If there is not enough basketball players in GUC to participate in ABC, print -1. The answer will be accepted if it has absolute or relative error not exceeding "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10 - 6"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 1\n2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 1\n1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 1\n2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0.666667\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example all 3 players (2 from department 1 and 1 from department 2) must be chosen for the team. Both players from Wafa's departments will be chosen, so he's guaranteed to have a teammate from his department."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, there are not enough players."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, there are three possibilities to compose the team containing Herr Wafa. In two of them the other player from Herr Wafa's department is part of the team."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"107B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/107/problem/B"}